   <text>
      <body>

         <div n="1">
            <head>Shiji I: Basic Annals</head>
            <p><title>Basic Annals of Qin</title>: <span corresp="second_year">In the second year</span> he sent <persName n="26">Meng Ao</persName> to attack <placeName n="9">Zhao</placeName> and <span corresp="settled_Taiyuan">settled <placeName n="145">Taiyuan</placeName></span>.</p>
         </div>

         <div n="2">
            <head>Shiji II: Tables</head>
            <p><placeName n="1">Qin</placeName>: <span corresp="Meng_Ao"><persName n="26">Meng Ao</persName></span> struck <placeName n="9">Zhao</placeName>'s <placeName n="72">Yuci</placeName>, <placeName n="146">Xincheng</placeName> and <placeName n="147">Langmeng</placeName>,</p>
            <p>and took <span corresp="thirty_seven_Fortresses">thirty-seven <term n="12">Fortresses</term></span>.</p>
            <p><span corresp="Eclipse_of_the_sun">Eclipse of the sun.</span></p>
            <p><placeName n="11">Chu</placeName>: <persName n="47">Lord Chunshen</persName>'s <span corresp="fief_was_moved_to_Wu">fief was moved to <placeName n="73">Wu</placeName></span>.</p>
         </div>

         <div n="3">
            <head>Shiji III: Hereditary Houses</head>
            <p><title>Hereditary House of Duke Shao of Yan</title>: <span corresp="seventh_year">In the seventh year</span>, <placeName n="1">Qin</placeName> took <placeName n="9">Zhao</placeName>'s <placeName n="72">Yuci</placeName> and <span corresp="thirty_seven_Fortresses">thirty-seven <term n="12">Fortresses</term></span>; Qin set up <span corresp="Taiyuan_Commandery"><placeName n="145">Taiyuan <term n="38">Commandery</term></placeName></span>.</p>
            <p><title>Hereditary House of Zhao</title>: <span corresp="eighteenth_year">In the eighteenth year</span>, <persName n="127">Yanling Jun</persName> led an army under the <term n="46">Chancellor of State</term> <span corresp="Lord_Xinping"><persName n="76">Lord Xinping</persName></span> to help <placeName n="10">Wei</placeName> attack <placeName n="14">Yan</placeName>. Qin took our Yuci and thirty-seven Fortresses.</p>
         </div>

      </body>
